<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali federal forces and U.S. airstrikes have recently killed dozens of al-Shabaab militants in Lower Shabelle, while Turkish-made missiles were identified in a deadly airstrike in Puntland, linking the conflict to external weapon supplies. The parliament speaker has accused Kenya, Ethiopia and Uganda of colluding with al-Shabaab, and the president has blamed the UAE for financing armed groups, while the Somali government warned that Houthi support could boost al-Shabaab's attack capabilities. Foreign troops are beginning to withdraw from Somalia, raising concerns that al-Shabaab could expand its influence. The United States has reversed its funding for international military support to Somalia. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168874&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9BZ1BZd1ZUVElkZnJFNXAtV2RwT1hfMUlGejUwekRUSVZVWEhKQ0dCWDlJN2J6aGU0dWhrbE1KcHhaOEZrblJ3eWRMYVlxRnBCNXFsWlBCVmkzcHVkU0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOY0dyaTRNZXgtS2lrc0l0c001WEpYdXp5OUowWEx3QU9ZRXViZVh1UGZQaERtOTRuZGZ0TzJZeTZoUmtxOE00TERiR0VQUlRQamFJYVZ1dU5UWFlSNzZfMGVTTlQxWXRFMXk2MXplZVFTUmhqS0lzVlRhRkVDQ2t2cXZzak5SYmhfNW91YXVTd0ZKaGlNRS05NlNsU2gxWmNENEg4R2psaGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE80LV94STM1SUl4STJUdTFIakJwZkItTGtuR2ExaUJUM3BZUjA5YkhuR21oRFVaM2REVndTMGhIWDVObE5VWnNyVWVITTBtalFDQ3lzXzY0YWxaUDJSVEtnWDlDejBkUHJieDBn?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOWTVJMk1sVzh4N0MzeWhIR3ZQNFFNUW1J